stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Created

    Created   --> Assigned   : assigned_at<br/>(Dispatch API)
    Assigned  --> Ready      : status = READY<br/>(restaurant_status.csv)
    Ready     --> PickedUp   : pickup_at<br/>(SQLite orders)
    Assigned  --> PickedUp   : pickup_at<br/><i>Ready unobserved for 90% of orders</i>
    PickedUp  --> Delivered  : actual_delivery_at
    Created   --> Cancelled  : final_status = cancelled

    Delivered --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Assigned
        Dispatch latency: ~2.3 min median.
        Identical for late and on-time orders,
        so dispatch timing is NOT the constraint.
    end note

    note right of PickedUp
        assigned to pickup is where delay lives:
        20.5 min on-time vs 37.5 min late.
        +17 min of the ~21 min total excess.
    end note

    note right of Delivered
        Transit contributes only ~+4 min.
    end note
